    <h1>13 Days Silk Road Group Tour: Xinjiang, Gansu, Qinghai</h1>
    <div class="route">📍 Kashgar → Urumqi → Turpan → Dunhuang → Jiayuguan → Zhangye → Xining → Chaka</div>
